    },
    "notes": [
      "页首查表值按像素忠实写为1.555；同页后续等式印为1.565，不把二者静默统一。",
      "例5的根式近似值、例6末尾等式各有一次真实跨印刷行断点，以↵记录。",
      "习题806题干在页末，分题须由物理240接续，使用ex open。"
    ],
    "errata": [
      {
        "id": "p0239-math-1",
        "block": "p0239#1",
        "original": "$\\sqrt{2.45}\\approx1.555$",
        "reason": "1.555的平方为2.418025，不是2.45在四位有效数字查表精度下的平方根；sqrt(2.45)约1.565247584，四位有效数字为1.565，且同页下一步确实印为1.565。原式仍忠实保留。"
      }
    ],
    "printed_lines": 26,
    "figures": [],
    "provenance": {
      "cap": "1",
      "normalized": true
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "查表求出$\\sqrt{2.45}$的值：",
        "$\\sqrt{2.45}\\approx1.555$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "那么",
        "$\\sqrt{245}=\\sqrt{2.45}\\times10\\approx1.565\\times10=15.65$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 求$\\sqrt{5634}$的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把5634写成$56.34\\times10^2$，那么",
        "$\\sqrt{56.34\\times10^2}=\\sqrt{56.34}\\times10$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "查表求出$\\sqrt{56.3}\\approx7.503$. 在修正值表编号为4的直行里找到",
        "修正值3，把它加到7.503的最后一个数字上，得到：$\\sqrt{56.34}↵\\approx7.506$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，",
        "$\\sqrt{5634}=10\\sqrt{56.34}\\approx75.06$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6. 求$\\sqrt{0.235}$的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "0.235比23.5小100倍. （23.5的平方根可通过查表求",
        "出. ）因此",
        "$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为",
        "$\\sqrt{23.5\\times10^{-2}}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以",
        "$\\sqrt{0.235}=\\sqrt{23.5}\\times10^{-1}\\approx4.848\\times10^{-1}↵=0.4848$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地，为了求出小于1或大于100的正数的平方根，应",
        "当把这个数写成$a\\times10^{2k}$（$1\\leq a<100$，$k$是整数），再利用关于",
        "积的平方根的定理求得结果."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "806",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "806. 查表求下列各数的平方根："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "233"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
